{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52207","headline":"颂六十二首 三十二 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤人慕高节，志愿菩提因。\n御鹤翔伊水，策马出王田。\n本祈立弘誓，感报弥陁身。\n能仁修八正，超逾九劫前。\n声流徧三界，慈化通大千。\n掩尘息妄想，凡圣幷欣然。\n含生同志趣，保益啓心神。\n生死必永尽，岂同庄老仙。\n（见同书同卷《发愿篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}